<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - Tenders total A$60 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - Tenders total A$60 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two promissory note tenders worth a total of A$60 million were fed to the Australian commercial paper market on Thursday.</p>
<p>International Business Machines Corp made the largest issue, selling A$40 million worth of p-notes at two to three basis points over the mid-rate for 30-day bank bills.</p>
<p>The physical bank bill yield curve was little changed from Wednesday on minimal turnover, dealers said.</p>
